      "widgets_values": [
        "{\"version\":1,\"content\":\"<h1>WHAT EACH NODE DOES</h1><p>\\n\\n</p><p>The colour of a node tells you what kind of node it is. Nothing here needs changing except the blue ones.</p><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #b8b8b8\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><h2><span data-ic=\\\"chip\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;The steps you set</h2><p>\\n\\n</p><p>Blue, and numbered. These are the only nodes you need to touch.</p><p>\\n\\n</p><ul><li><b>Load Images from Folder Pixaroma (1. your folder)</b> - Point it at a folder and pick the pictures. Press Run once and it sends every picture through the workflow, one after the other. Its <b>filename</b> output carries each picture's name to the save node, and <b>index</b> says which picture it is (1, 2, 3 ...).</li><li><b>Resize Crop Pixaroma (2. square post 1080 x 1080)</b> - Crops every picture to a <b>1080 x 1080</b> square, the classic feed post.</li><li><b>Resize Crop Pixaroma (3. portrait post 1080 x 1350)</b> - Crops every picture to <b>1080 x 1350</b>, the tall feed post that takes more of the screen.</li><li><b>Resize Crop Pixaroma (4. story 1080 x 1920)</b> - Crops every picture to <b>1080 x 1920</b>, the full-screen size for stories, reels and shorts.</li></ul><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #b8b8b8\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><h2><span data-ic=\\\"checkmark\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;The result</h2><p>\\n\\n</p><p>Dark red, at the end.</p><p>\\n\\n</p><ul><li><b>Save Image Pixaroma (square)</b> - Saves the squares as JPG into <code>ComfyUI/output/Social Media/Square</code>, each with its original name.</li><li><b>Save Image Pixaroma (portrait)</b> - Saves the tall posts into <code>Social Media/Portrait</code>.</li><li><b>Save Image Pixaroma (story)</b> - Saves the stories into <code>Social Media/Story</code>.</li></ul><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #b8b8b8\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><h2><span data-ic=\\\"info\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;Readouts</h2><p>\\n\\n</p><p>Dark. Nothing to set: they show you what happened.</p><p>\\n\\n</p><ul><li><b>Run Timer</b> - The dark clock above the result shows how long the last Run took.</li></ul><p>\\n\\n</p>\",\"buttonColor\":\"#f66744\",\"lineColor\":\"#f66744\",\"backgroundColor\":\"#2a2a2a\",\"info\":{\"title\":\"Nodes Info\",\"icon\":\"node-v5\",\"color\":\"#3d7cc9\"}}"
      ],
